Revision history for HTTP-API-Client

0.03  2026-08-16
    - Add a common pagination iterator API.
    - Support next-URL, page-number, and cursor pagination modes.
    - Support dotted-path or coderef extractors for items and continuation values.
    - Detect repeated continuations to avoid infinite pagination loops.

0.02  2026-08-16
    - Add conservative automatic retry support.
    - Retry GET/HEAD/PUT/DELETE/OPTIONS by default, but not POST/PATCH.
    - Add exponential backoff with jitter and numeric Retry-After support.
    - Allow retry policy overrides per client and per request.

0.01  2026-08-16
    - Initial release.
    - Base URL, headers, JSON request/response handling, timeout configuration.
    - Structured HTTP, transport, and decode errors.
